  "question": {
    "text": "The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> satisfying the equation <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to"
  },
